pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 20]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: BEFORE WE START}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 66, 830, 40]
    content: {style: "$title", wrap: false, text: Two things to learn in the next ten minutes}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 116, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1 832,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: part1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 150, 90, 52]
    content: {style: "$stepnum", wrap: false, text: "01"}
  - elementId: part1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 152, 660, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      bold: true
      color: "$slate"
      wrap: false
      text: The story — what happened at 09:30 this morning
  - elementId: part1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 190, 660, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>A fictional patrol is in the field and its movement details may have been
        disclosed. You are the incoming SOC shift. Everything you investigate is
        fictional, pre-collected, and safe to touch.</p>
  - elementId: part2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 280, 90, 52]
    content: {style: "$stepnum", wrap: false, text: "02"}
  - elementId: part2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 282, 660, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      bold: true
      color: "$slate"
      wrap: false
      text: Your setup — four browser tabs and one desktop
  - elementId: part2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 320, 660, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>We walk through every login, click by click, until your team has claimed
        its first ticket and answered its first question. No prior knowledge assumed.</p>
  - elementId: exit-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 420, 200, 22]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: WHEN WE'RE DONE}
  - elementId: exit-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 446, 832, 50]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>You will know the incident story, be logged into everything, and have
        points on the board. Then the exercise clock starts for real.</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "2"}
